Radford, A. et al. (2019). Language Models are Unsupervised Multitask \
Learners. (GPT-2.)
Taori, R. et al. (2023). Stanford Alpaca: An Instruction-Following LLaMA Model.
Yahma. (2023). alpaca-cleaned (HuggingFace dataset, Apache 2.0).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cb23c3af-d2f3-4596-9c69-306550659af9"]
}, Open  ]]
